{"h":1,"schema":"sd/1","seq":18,"at":"2026-09-23T13:44:08.415633Z","kind":"provider_body","adapter":"langsmith-ingest/0.1.0","dialect":"langsmith/1","src":".","session":"ls-history-history-middleware-7bf102b808e4"}
{"ord":1,"off":0,"sha":"0fd8b5ed1e67","bytes":4251,"id":"01a0ce82-594c-75c3-af02-0ac7b3f6bc3e:request","call":"01a0ce82-594c-75c3-af02-0ac7b3f6bc3e","run":"01a0ce82-1e37-78b2-8c65-990b0fbe63a8","model":"deepseek.v3.2","parts":[{"k":"data","data":"Here is a summary of the conversation to date:\n\n## SESSION INTENT\nDiagnose performance issues within the microservices system, starting with the checkout service and then the payment service, to identify the root cause of latency degradation.\n\n## SUMMARY\nThe checkout service has severe performance degradation (p99 latency: 2350ms vs. 410ms an hour ago, 1.2% error rate). Analysis identified calls to the payment service as a major contributor (p99: 2210ms). The payment service itself is confirmed as a root cause, showing even more severe degradation (p99 latency: 2190ms vs. 220ms an hour ago, 1.9% error rate). A critical finding is that the payment service's database connection pool is completely saturated (20/20 connections in use), causing high wait times (p99: 1840ms) for database connections. The user has now asked to check the inventory service.\n\n## ARTIFACTS\nNone\n\n## NEXT STEPS\nCheck the health of the inventory service as requested by the user to see if it is also experiencing performance issues or contributing to the overall system degradation.","state":"available","bytes":1079},{"k":"data","data":{"schema":"provider_body/1","role":"request","src":"runs-20260923T134404.230131000Z-000002.request","sha256":"0fd8b5ed1e670e2d2af4b6b0f36c40766c7edc30e5dd22c0734e39658db384df","bytes":4251,"depth":0,"chain":"5baa50015c4c75c4","model":"deepseek.v3.2","session":"ls-history-history-middleware-7bf102b808e4","run":"01a0ce82-1e37-78b2-8c65-990b0fbe63a8","call":"01a0ce82-594c-75c3-af02-0ac7b3f6bc3e","segments":[{"lit":"{\"messages\":[[{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"schema\",\"messages\",\"SystemMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":\"You check the health of services in a monitored system. Use the tool. Answer in two sentences.\",\"type\":\"system\"}},{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"schema\",\"messages\",\"HumanMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":"},{"part":0},{"lit":",\"additional_kwargs\":{\"lc_source\":\"summarization\"},\"type\":\"human\",\"id\":\"e94f94f0-68ca-4146-903c-31ca8edc3797\"}},{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"schema\",\"messages\",\"AIMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"I'll check the health of the inventory service for you.\\n\\n<｜DSML｜function_calls\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"name\":\"service_health\",\"input\":{\"service\":\"inventory\"},\"id\":\"tooluse_XC4MUtPFpMcGVwrjYTFVV3\"}],\"response_metadata\":{\"ResponseMetadata\":{\"RequestId\":\"7eea1690-48fb-4afb-9343-41b9dfb39924\",\"HTTPStatusCode\":200,\"HTTPHeaders\":{\"date\":\"Wed, 23 Sep 2026 13:43:46 GMT\",\"content-type\":\"application/json\",\"content-length\":\"404\",\"connection\":\"keep-alive\",\"x-amzn-requestid\":\"7eea1690-48fb-4afb-9343-41b9dfb39924\"},\"RetryAttempts\":0},\"stopReason\":\"tool_use\",\"metrics\":{\"latencyMs\":[1759]},\"model_provider\":\"bedrock_converse\",\"model_name\":\"deepseek.v3.2\"},\"type\":\"ai\",\"id\":\"lc_run--01a0ce82-0e48-7421-be26-32080a141b1b-0\",\"tool_calls\":[{\"name\":\"service_health\",\"args\":{\"service\":\"inventory\"},\"id\":\"tooluse_XC4MUtPFpMcGVwrjYTFVV3\",\"type\":\"tool_call\"}],\"usage_metadata\":{\"input_tokens\":731,\"output_tokens\":57,\"total_tokens\":788,\"input_token_details\":{\"cache_creation\":0,\"cache_read\":0}},\"invalid_tool_calls\":[]}},{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",\"id\":[\"langchain\",\"schema\",\"messages\",\"ToolMessage\"],\"kwargs\":{\"content\":\"{\\\"p99_ms\\\": 61, \\\"p99_ms_1h_ago\\\": 58, \\\"error_rate\\\": 0.0}\",\"type\":\"tool\",\"name\":\"service_health\",\"id\":\"44694275-ffb1-46fb-b795-036037b5c694\",\"tool_call_id\":\"tooluse_XC4MUtPFpMcGVwrjYTFVV3\",\"status\":\"success\"}},{\"lc\":1,\"type\":\"constructor\",